{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;Your next case, Mr Investigator. That's what she calls you.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the timeline of a murder through exploring the victim's diary, use your detective intuition and restore the missing content inside the diary. As memories of each day are recreated in the record, cross examine evidence and clues inside those memories and piece together the truth behind the killing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Detective Work With The Past</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mr Investigator</i> is a first-person murder investigation based on evidence analysis and logical deduction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i> </i></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the day of the event.\u00a0<br>\u2014 Characters waiting to be examined.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/de15eb12dfb8e067910d0b0aa6253097.poster.avif?t=1759871780\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/de15eb12dfb8e067910d0b0aa6253097.webm?t=1759871780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/de15eb12dfb8e067910d0b0aa6253097.mp4?t=1759871780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solve a incomplete record.<br>\u2014 Gain insight with each question answered.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/adf255ddde832e3bdbf370b6da82442e.poster.avif?t=1759871780\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816830/extras/adf255dd